# The build context is the repo root (see apps/law/backend/Dockerfile):
# npm ci needs every workspace manifest and the bundle inlines the
# commons packages from source. Installed and generated trees never
# enter the context — the image installs from the lockfile and builds
# its own dist/ (isc-assistant precedent).
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
